WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:34.420
Tom was at the Royal Fair.

2
00:00:34.421 --> 00:00:37.204
"Look," said Cook.

3
00:00:37.205 --> 00:00:41.118
"It's a grab bag game!"

4
00:00:41.119 --> 00:00:45.587
"Grab bags are fun," the royal weaver said.

5
00:00:45.588 --> 00:00:48.561
"Let's play!"

6
00:00:48.562 --> 00:00:52.010
Everyone put a gift card in the bag.

7
00:00:52.011 --> 00:00:55.702
Cook put in a card for a free feast.

8
00:00:55.703 --> 00:00:59.402
The royal barber gave a free haircut.

9
00:00:59.403 --> 00:01:10.292
Tom's card said, One Free Magic Spell.

10
00:01:10.293 --> 00:01:16.805
Everyone picked a card from the bag.

11
00:01:16.806 --> 00:01:21.583
Tom took his turn.

12
00:01:21.584 --> 00:01:23.947
He pulled out a card.

13
00:01:23.948 --> 00:01:28.553
"I won a rug from the royal weaver!"

14
00:01:28.554 --> 00:01:32.785
Next it was Dirk's turn.

15
00:01:32.786 --> 00:01:43.469
Tom held his breath.

16
00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:45.539
Dirk was mean.

17
00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:49.043
Tom did not want to do a spell for him.

18
00:01:49.044 --> 00:01:53.568
Dirk pulled out a card.

19
00:01:53.569 --> 00:01:59.541
He looked at it and frowned.

20
00:01:59.542 --> 00:02:02.927
"What did you get?" Cook asked.

21
00:02:02.928 --> 00:02:07.570
Dirk didn't say anything.

22
00:02:07.571 --> 00:02:10.509
Tom was worried.

23
00:02:10.510 --> 00:02:15.082
"What if Dirk has my card?" he thought.

24
00:02:15.083 --> 00:02:18.043
More people picked cards.

25
00:02:18.044 --> 00:02:23.475
Finally there was one card left.

26
00:02:23.476 --> 00:02:28.108
A knight reached into the bag.

27
00:02:28.109 --> 00:02:30.902
"Oh goody!" the knight said.

28
00:02:30.903 --> 00:02:34.974
"I won the magic spell!"

29
00:02:34.975 --> 00:02:37.844
"Whew!" Tom thought.

30
00:02:37.845 --> 00:02:42.669
He was glad that Dirk did not get his card.

31
00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:50.477
Later the knight walked over to Tom.

32
00:02:50.478 --> 00:02:54.796
"I'll come to the lab tomorrow," the knight said.

33
00:02:54.797 --> 00:02:56.583
The knight smiled.

34
00:02:56.584 --> 00:03:00.848
Tom shivered.

35
00:03:00.849 --> 00:03:07.802
The knight had a nasty look on his face.
